    "is_free": false,
    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1095800/extras/4b2fe8ecd200a69fc1dc92106a070421.poster.avif?t=1754431221\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1095800/extras/4b2fe8ecd200a69fc1dc92106a070421.webm?t=1754431221\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1095800/extras/4b2fe8ecd200a69fc1dc92106a070421.mp4?t=1754431221\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Rock Paper Clash</strong> is a fast-paced, chaotic multiplayer battle arena where your only weapons are the timeless trio: <strong>rock, paper, and scissors</strong>.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Dive into the mayhem with friends or face off against players from around the world in wild, unpredictable showdowns across a variety of quirky and dynamic arenas.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Outsmart, outplay, and outlast your opponents in the ultimate game of chance and strategy\u2014reimagined for pure multiplayer madness.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1095800/extras/146b5f47798e1e82b5038fb12127e09f.poster.avif?t=1754431221\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1095800/extras/146b5f47798e1e82b5038fb12127e09f.webm?t=1754431221\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1095800/extras/146b5f47798e1e82b5038fb12127e09f.mp4?t=1754431221\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div></p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1095800/extras/4b2fe8ecd200a69fc1dc92106a070421.poster.avif?t=1754431221\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1095800/extras/4b2fe8ecd200a69fc1dc92106a070421.webm?t=1754431221\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1095800/extras/4b2fe8ecd200a69fc1dc92106a070421.mp4?t=1754431221\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Rock Paper Clash</strong> is a fast-paced, chaotic multiplayer battle arena where your only weapons are the timeless trio: <strong>rock, paper, and scissors</strong>.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Dive into the mayhem with friends or face off against players from around the world in wild, unpredictable showdowns across a variety of quirky and dynamic arenas.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Outsmart, outplay, and outlast your opponents in the ultimate game of chance and strategy\u2014reimagined for pure multiplayer madness.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1095800/extras/146b5f47798e1e82b5038fb12127e09f.poster.avif?t=1754431221\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1095800/extras/146b5f47798e1e82b5038fb12127e09f.webm?t=1754431221\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1095800/extras/146b5f47798e1e82b5038fb12127e09f.mp4?t=1754431221\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div></p>",
